      "shortDescription": "OEMER designs and manufactures high-performance industrial electric motors for inverter-controlled drives. Its official range includes asynchronous induction motors, permanent-magnet servomotors, synchronous-reluctance motors, direct-drive torque motors and air- or liquid-cooled configurations.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "OEMER Motori Elettrici S.p.A. is an Italian electric-motor manufacturer founded in 1949 and based in Rescaldina near Milan. The company develops and manufactures high-performance motors for industrial machinery, drive systems, power electronics and automation applications, with electrical and mechanical customization available for specific projects.",
        "The documented portfolio covers three-phase asynchronous inverter-duty motors, low-inertia motor configurations, liquid-cooled induction motors, permanent-magnet servomotors, IE4 permanent-magnet motors, synchronous-reluctance motors, high-torque direct-drive motors and compact or IEC-frame motors. Official application material identifies plastics and rubber, metal, paper and tissue, textiles, stone and ceramics, wood processing, logistics, packaging, marine systems, testing equipment, environmental technology and industrial vehicles among the served sectors."
      ],
