      "shortDescription": "ÖLFLEX is LAPP's product brand for flexible power, connection and control cables. The official range covers standard, halogen-free, harsh-environment, servo and motor, drag-chain, robotic, torsion, temperature-resistant and industry-specific cable families.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "ÖLFLEX is the LAPP product brand for power, connection and control cables. Oskar and Ursula Ida Lapp introduced the name in 1957 for the first industrially manufactured flexible control cable with color-coded conductors, establishing the product on which the LAPP business was built.",
        "The current official portfolio spans power and control cables for standard and demanding environments, halogen-free constructions, servo and motor connections, cable chains, robots and torsional movement, spiral cables, elevator and conveyor systems, elevated-temperature service, infrastructure, solar, wind and railway applications. LAPP also uses the ÖLFLEX CONNECT name for ready-to-connect cable assemblies and engineered servo or cable-chain systems."
