      "country": "Germany",
      "headquarters": null,
      "foundedYear": 1957,
      "parentCompany": "HyPneu GmbH Hydraulik und Pneumatik",
      "statusModifier": "LEGACY_BRAND",
      "shortDescription": "ORSTA is a legacy German hydraulics and pneumatics brand whose registered trademark is owned by HyPneu. HyPneu supplies original spare and exchange units, manufactures selected ORSTA components to former TGL specifications, and builds or repairs ORSTA hydraulic and pneumatic cylinders.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "ORSTA originated with the former VEB Kombinat ORSTA-Hydraulik Leipzig. The historical operation was discontinued in 1994, and HyPneu GmbH was created from its former technical sales office. HyPneu acquired the ORSTA trademark rights in 2010 and now presents ORSTA as its own registered brand rather than as an operating ORSTA Hydraulik AG company.",
        "The current official ORSTA scope includes original spare parts, exchange units, repair services and selected newly manufactured components made by HyPneu to original TGL documentation. Documented new-production examples include gear pumps to TGL 10859 and TGL 37069, directional valves to TGL 26223/60, and hydraulic or pneumatic cylinders built to former ORSTA standards. HyPneu also maintains a technical library of TGL data sheets for legacy ORSTA components."
      ],
      "productCategories": [
